  - m_Id: 80018093347512341
    m_Localized: A unique animal with a long snout and sharp claws. It quietly approaches
      and strikes at the enemy's opening.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80018093347512335
    m_Localized: A defensive animal that protects itself with a hard shell. When
      danger comes, it curls up and calmly holds its ground.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80018093347512346
    m_Localized: A clever animal that hides in snowy fields with its white fur. It
      moves quietly and waits for the enemy to drop its guard.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80018093347512344
    m_Localized: A small friend that quickly hops through the white snow. It may
      look quiet, but it moves more nimbly than anyone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80018093347512336
    m_Localized: A friend that keeps walking steadily even through scorching sandstorms.
      With endurance for long journeys, it protects the desert path.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80018093347512340
    m_Localized: A relaxed and gentle animal that makes everyone feel at ease. But
      when its friends are in danger, it quietly stands guard.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80018093347512325
    m_Localized: With long legs and sharp senses, it notices distant danger before
      anyone else. Quiet, but never hesitates to protect the meadow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80018093347512343
    m_Localized: A reliable guardian of the forest with a huge body and great strength.
      Calm and relaxed, but each step carries a heavy presence.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80018093347512339
    m_Localized: A forest friend that hops around with a small body. Its quick movements
      confuse enemies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80018093347512327
    m_Localized: A meadow watcher that surveys far away with its long neck. It may
      look relaxed, but it warns friends before danger arrives.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80018093347512332
    m_Localized: A dependable friend that blocks the way with a large body and great
      strength. Usually relaxed, but hard to stop when angered.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80018093347512337
    m_Localized: It never misses an opening with sharp senses and quick judgment.
      It may look like it is smiling, but on the battlefield it is a clever hunter.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80018093347512342
    m_Localized: An agile hunter that silently crosses the forest. It uses swift
      movement to strike when the enemy lets its guard down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80018093347512329
    m_Localized: A mysterious friend that drifts gently with the waves. It looks
      soft, but gives a stinging strike to enemies that get close.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80018093347512338
    m_Localized: A guardian of the desert with great strength and dignity. When it
      roars, every nearby enemy becomes tense.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80018093347512345
    m_Localized: It waddles when walking, but bravely moves forward on the ice. A
      cute warrior that quickly gets back up even after falling.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80018093347512348
    m_Localized: A strong guardian of the land of snow and ice. Its huge body blocks
      the enemy's path like a reliable shield.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80018093347512324
    m_Localized: A scout that quickly moves through the grass with a small body.
      It may look timid, but it moves before anyone else for its friends.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80018093347512347
    m_Localized: A reliable friend that never loses its way even in a snowstorm.
      With large antlers, it opens the path and leads its allies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80018093347512334
    m_Localized: It hides in the sand and appears at the decisive moment. Small,
      but its sharp tail keeps enemies on edge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80018093347512331
    m_Localized: Fast in the water and cutely wobbly on land. Its playful nature
      gives strength to its ocean friends.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80018093347512330
    m_Localized: An animal that protects itself with a hard shell and slowly moves
      forward. It may look slow, but it is a dependable ocean friend that never gives
      up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80018093347512328
    m_Localized: A guardian of the meadow with great strength and sharp movement.
      It waits quietly and unleashes its power at the decisive moment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80018093347512333
    m_Localized: A huge guardian that carries the vast ocean within it. Even its
      heavy movement puts great pressure on enemies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 80018093347512326
    m_Localized: A clever hunter that moves with its pack and targets enemy openings.
      It may look a little scary, but it is a reliable guardian for its friends.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
